WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A short session might fit a busy day.
But convenience is not a clinical experiment.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A company can describe forty-eight recordings
without proving that an hour of meditation happens in twelve minutes.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Research explores mindfulness and sound,
but not every marketed recording.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The older history of suggestion reminds us
to separate reports from explanations.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before paying for a promise, try twelve quiet minutes.
Write down what you actually finish,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
check the evidence,
and decide for yourself.
